{'symbol': 'HRL', 'date': '2022-05-23 17:00:00', 'title': 'HORMEL FOODS CORPORATION DECLARES QUARTERLY DIVIDEND', 'text': 'AUSTIN, MINN. , MAY 23, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- HORMEL FOODS CORPORATION (NYSE: HRL), A GLOBAL BRANDED FOOD COMPANY, ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT ITS QUARTERLY DIVIDEND ON THE COMMON STOCK, AUTHORIZED BY THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS AT\xa026 CENTS\xa0($0.26)\xa0A SHARE ON\xa0MAY 23, 2022, WILL BE PAID\xa0AUGUST 15, 2022, TO STOCKHOLDERS OF RECORD AT THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON\xa0JULY 11, 2022.'}